# em-frontend

A visualisation of the Event Model produced by the emcli.

## Tech stack

- Javascript
- Pixi.js for rendering
- Custom-built grid-layout calculator (no library)
- Custom-built edge-routing algorithm (no library)
- Static build served by a small launcher (`scripts/launch.mjs`) that opens the
  user's own browser (chromium `--app=` mode, falling back to `xdg-open`) —
  no embedded webview. Packaged for distribution via babashka/bbin.

## Guidelines
- Use an idiomatic functional style

## End goal
- Package as a single binary
